# Exclude the entire workspace tree by default; opt back in to just the
# bundled extension entry and the metadata files VS Code needs.
**

# Re-include the metadata + bundle + content the marketplace expects:
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!CHANGELOG.md
!out/extension.js
!out/extension.js.map
!syntaxes/
!syntaxes/turtle.tmLanguage.json
!syntaxes/sparql.tmLanguage.json
!language-configuration/
!language-configuration/turtle.json
!language-configuration/sparql.json
